{"title":"Optimization passes, one at a time","sub":"Each pass is a small, mechanical rewrite of the IR. Chained together, they add up.","kind":"grid","interval":1500,"grid":{"colLabels":["instruction","uses"],"mono":true},"legend":[["a","rewritten by this pass"],["b","about to be removed"],["bad","no uses"],["muted","removed"]],"frames":[{"caption":"The function <code>return a + 4*8 + b*8</code>, with a leftover <code>unused = b*2</code>, in SSA form. The right column counts each value's uses.","cells":[["%k = mul i32 4, 8","1"],["%unused = mul i32 %b, 2","0"],["%m = mul i32 %b, 8","1"],["%s = add i32 %a, %k","1"],["%r = add i32 %s, %m","1"],["ret i32 %r",""]],"cellCls":{},"stats":[["Instructions",6]]},{"caption":"<b>Constant folding</b>: <code>%k = mul i32 4, 8</code> only involves constants, so compute it now: <b>32</b>.","cells":[["%k = 32","1"],["%unused = mul i32 %b, 2","0"],["%m = mul i32 %b, 8","1"],["%s = add i32 %a, %k","1"],["%r = add i32 %s, %m","1"],["ret i32 %r",""]],"cellCls":{"0,0":"a"},"stats":[["Instructions",6]]},{"caption":"<b>Constant propagation</b>: %k is just 32, so use 32 directly. In SSA, %k has exactly one definition, so this is always safe.","cells":[["%k = 32","0"],["%unused = mul i32 %b, 2","0"],["%m = mul i32 %b, 8","1"],["%s = add i32 %a, 32","1"],["%r = add i32 %s, %m","1"],["ret i32 %r",""]],"cellCls":{"3,0":"a"},"stats":[["Instructions",6]]},{"caption":"<b>Dead code elimination</b>: %k has <b>0 uses</b>, so nothing depends on it.","cells":[["%k = 32","0"],["%unused = mul i32 %b, 2","0"],["%m = mul i32 %b, 8","1"],["%s = add i32 %a, 32","1"],["%r = add i32 %s, %m","1"],["ret i32 %r",""]],"cellCls":{"0,0":"b","0,1":"bad"},"stats":[["Instructions",6]]},{"caption":"Delete it. (Deleting an instruction can leave others unused, so the pass repeats until nothing changes.)","cells":[["removed",""],["%unused = mul i32 %b, 2","0"],["%m = mul i32 %b, 8","1"],["%s = add i32 %a, 32","1"],["%r = add i32 %s, %m","1"],["ret i32 %r",""]],"cellCls":{"0,0":"muted","0,1":"muted"},"stats":[["Instructions",5]]},{"caption":"<b>Dead code elimination</b>: %unused has <b>0 uses</b>, so nothing depends on it.","cells":[["removed",""],["%unused = mul i32 %b, 2","0"],["%m = mul i32 %b, 8","1"],["%s = add i32 %a, 32","1"],["%r = add i32 %s, %m","1"],["ret i32 %r",""]],"cellCls":{"0,0":"muted","0,1":"muted","1,0":"b","1,1":"bad"},"stats":[["Instructions",5]]},{"caption":"Delete it. (Deleting an instruction can leave others unused, so the pass repeats until nothing changes.)","cells":[["removed",""],["removed",""],["%m = mul i32 %b, 8","1"],["%s = add i32 %a, 32","1"],["%r = add i32 %s, %m","1"],["ret i32 %r",""]],"cellCls":{"0,0":"muted","0,1":"muted","1,0":"muted","1,1":"muted"},"stats":[["Instructions",4]]},{"caption":"<b>Strength reduction</b>: multiplying by 8 is a left shift by 3, a cheaper instruction.","cells":[["removed",""],["removed",""],["%m = shl i32 %b, 3","1"],["%s = add i32 %a, 32","1"],["%r = add i32 %s, %m","1"],["ret i32 %r",""]],"cellCls":{"0,0":"muted","0,1":"muted","1,0":"muted","1,1":"muted","2,0":"a"},"stats":[["Instructions",4]]},{"caption":"From 6 instructions to 4, and the function now computes <code>a + 32 + (b &lt;&lt; 3)</code>: the same result, with less work.","cells":[["removed",""],["removed",""],["%m = shl i32 %b, 3","1"],["%s = add i32 %a, 32","1"],["%r = add i32 %s, %m","1"],["ret i32 %r",""]],"cellCls":{"0,0":"muted","0,1":"muted","1,0":"muted","1,1":"muted"},"stats":[["Instructions",4]]}]}